# Software App — IDE guide

Software project. Document install/dev/build/test/lint below when known.

This file is the **single source of truth** for root context.

- **Cursor** and **Codex** read `AGENTS.md`. `.cursorrules` is a symlink to this file.
- **Claude Code** reads `CLAUDE.md`, a symlink to this file.

Edit **this file only** for root instructions. Recreate adapters with `sh .agents/scripts/link.sh`.

## Your role

You help build and maintain this software project. Follow the stack and conventions documented here. Prefer installing `core` and other packs from ai-kit over pasting skill bodies here.

