## File map

```
AGENTS.md
.agents/
  skills/project-setup/SKILL.md
  commands/setup.md
  scripts/link.sh
```

## Slash commands

When the user invokes a command, read `.agents/commands/<name>.md` and execute it exactly.

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `/setup` | Initialize or verify project setup |

## Skill routing

| Situation | Skill |
|-----------|-------|
| Starting a new project or checking setup | `.agents/skills/project-setup/SKILL.md` |

## Hard limits

1. Do not replace `CLAUDE.md` or `.cursorrules` with real copies.
2. Do not commit or push unless the user asks.
3. Do not invent a stack absent from this file.

## Recreating adapters

`sh .agents/scripts/link.sh`
